OL,3,GNEWSALack of clarity over SEN taxi
OL,4,Asituation 'hurtful and frustrating'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man whose daughter has special
OL,7,Feducational needs has said it is
OL,8,F"hurtful and deeply frustrating" that
OL,9,Fthe Education Authority (EA) still has
OL,10,Fnot clarified what taxi firm will take
OL,11,Fher to and from school.
OL,13,FSeven-year-old Maisie was using a taxi
OL,14,Fcompany provided by the EA but the
OL,15,Fcontract has now gone out to tender.
OL,17,FHer father Columba Mailey said
OL,18,F"familiarity with the driver is crucial
OL,19,Ffor Maisie" adding that "24 hours
OL,20,Fbefore Maisie starts the new term we
OL,21,Fhave no clarity".
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
